    "html": "<p>In a double-slit experiment using coherent light of wavelength <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\lambda\"></span>, the central bright fringe is observed on a screen at point P. A point of destructive interference occurs at point Q. Only one point of constructive interference is observed between P and Q.</p>\n<p><br/></p>\n<p><figure data-asset-id=\"fig_01\"><img alt=\"Source question diagram 1\" src=\"asset:fig_01\"/></figure></p>\n<p><br/>What is the path difference at Q?</p>\n<p>[1]</p>\n<ol class=\"mcq-options\"><li data-label=\"A\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{\\lambda}{2}\"></span></li><li data-label=\"B\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\lambda\"></span></li><li data-label=\"C\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{3\\lambda}{2}\"></span></li><li data-label=\"D\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"2\\lambda\"></span></li></ol>"
  },
